      "skos:note": "Limitation on examination or processing of things"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3k-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3K(3A) Use of equipment to examine or process things",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 58,
      "values:originalText": "(3A) The thing may be moved to another place for examination or\nprocessing for no longer than whichever of the following is\napplicable:\n\n(a) if the thing is a computer or data storage device—30 days;\n\n(b) otherwise—14 days."
    },
    {
