    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3m-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3M(4) Compensation for damage to equipment",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3m-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.70",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In determining the amount of compensation payable, regard is to\nbe had to whether any of the following persons, if they were\navailable at the time, provided any appropriate warning or\nguidance on the operation of the equipment:\n\n(a) if the equipment was operated under a warrant issued in\nrelation to premises—the occupier of the premises, or the\noccupier’s employees or agents;\n\n(b) if the equipment was operated under a warrant issued in\nrelation to a person—that person, or that person’s agents.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In determining the amount of compensation payable, regard is to\nbe had to whether any of the following persons, if they were\navailable at the time, provided any appropriate warning or\nguidance on the operation of the equipment:\n\n(a) if the equipment was operated under a warrant issued in\nrelation to premises—the occupier of the premises, or the\noccupier’s employees or agents;\n\n(b) if the equipment was operated under a warrant issued in\nrelation to a person—that person, or that person’s agents.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3m"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3m-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3m-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f990142cd7a5b6b4f53044308c215a3c621469437bc16b6e566a71fbd34d6d3c",
      "skos:note": "Provide warning or guidance on equipment operation if available.",
      "dc:description": "yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3m-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3M(4) Compensation for damage to equipment",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 70,
      "values:originalText": "(4) In determining the amount of compensation payable, regard is to\nbe had to whether any of the following persons, if they were\navailable at the time, provided any appropriate warning or\nguidance on the operation of the equipment:\n\n(a) if the equipment was operated under a warrant issued in\nrelation to premises—the occupier of the premises, or the\noccupier’s employees or agents;\n\n(b) if the equipment was operated under a warrant issued in\nrelation to a person—that person, or that person’s agents."
    },
