      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.73",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If 2 or more things are seized or moved, they may be covered in\nthe one receipt.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If 2 or more things are seized or moved, they may be covered in\nthe one receipt.",
      "values:partOf": {
