    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3ub",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3UB Application of Subdivision",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3ub"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.79",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A police officer may exercise the powers under this Subdivision in\nrelation to a person if:\n\n(a) the person is in a Commonwealth place (other than a\nprescribed security zone) and the officer suspects on\nreasonable grounds that the person might have just\ncommitted, might be committing or might be about to\ncommit, a terrorist act; or\n\n(b) the person is in a Commonwealth place in a prescribed\nsecurity zone.\n\n(2) This section does not limit the operation of section 3UEA.\n3UC  Requirement to provide name etc.\n\n(1) A police officer may request the person to provide the officer with\nthe following details:\n\n(a) the person’s name;\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A police officer may exercise the powers under this Subdivision in\nrelation to a person if:\n\n(a) the person is in a Commonwealth place (other than a\nprescribed security zone) and the officer suspects on\nreasonable grounds that the person might have just\ncommitted, might be committing or might be about to\ncommit, a terrorist act; or\n\n(b) the person is in a Commonwealth place in a prescribed\nsecurity zone.\n\n(2) This section does not limit the operation of section 3UEA.\n3UC  Requirement to provide name etc.\n\n(1) A police officer may request the person to provide the officer with\nthe following details:\n\n(a) the person’s name;\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3ub-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3ub-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3ub-ss-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d4e960f4e2d0c95c07fa455e3382d72418ae2e8c2a94d1fa1661567651f111f1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3ub",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3UB Application of Subdivision",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 79,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A police officer may exercise the powers under this Subdivision in\nrelation to a person if:\n\n(a) the person is in a Commonwealth place (other than a\nprescribed security zone) and the officer suspects on\nreasonable grounds that the person might have just\ncommitted, might be committing or might be about to\ncommit, a terrorist act; or\n\n(b) the person is in a Commonwealth place in a prescribed\nsecurity zone.\n\n(2) This section does not limit the operation of section 3UEA.\n3UC  Requirement to provide name etc.\n\n(1) A police officer may request the person to provide the officer with\nthe following details:\n\n(a) the person’s name;\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)"
    },
