      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.80",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A person must not be detained under this section for longer than is\nreasonably necessary for a search to be conducted under this\nsection.\nOther conditions relating to conduct of search of person or thing",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A person must not be detained under this section for longer than is\nreasonably necessary for a search to be conducted under this\nsection.\nOther conditions relating to conduct of search of person or thing",
