        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(5) In the course of searching for the thing...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The police officer's actions are justified if they are necessary to protect life, health, or safety."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3ue-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3UE(6) Seizure of terrorism related items and serious offence related",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3ue-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.82",
      "values:originalText": "(6) In exercising powers under this section:\n\n(a) the police officer may use such assistance; and\n\n(b) the police officer, or a person who is also a police officer and\nwho is assisting the police officer, may use such force against\npersons and things; and\n\n(c) a person (other than a police officer) who is authorised by the\npolice officer to assist the police officer may use such force\nagainst things;\nas is necessary and reasonable in the circumstances.\nNotification",
      "skos:definition": "(6) In exercising powers under this section:\n\n(a) the police officer may use such assistance; and\n\n(b) the police officer, or a person who is also a police officer and\nwho is assisting the police officer, may use such force against\npersons and things; and\n\n(c) a person (other than a police officer) who is authorised by the\npolice officer to assist the police officer may use such force\nagainst things;\nas is necessary and reasonable in the circumstances.\nNotification",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3ue"
      },
