      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.82",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A police officer who has entered premises under, or purportedly\nunder, subsection 3UEA(1) must:\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A police officer who has entered premises under, or purportedly\nunder, subsection 3UEA(1) must:\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
