      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.88",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if:\n\n(a) both:\n\n(i) the owner of the thing cannot be identified after\nreasonable inquiries; and\n\n(ii) the thing was not seized from a person; or\n\n(b) it is not possible to serve the person required to be served\nunder subsection (1).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subsection (1) does not apply if:\n\n(a) both:\n\n(i) the owner of the thing cannot be identified after\nreasonable inquiries; and\n\n(ii) the thing was not seized from a person; or\n\n(b) it is not possible to serve the person required to be served\nunder subsection (1).",
