    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uf-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3UF(3) Seizure notices",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3uf-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.88",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A seizure notice must:\n\n(a) identify the thing; and\n\n(b) state the date on which the thing was seized; and\n\n(c) state the ground or grounds on which the thing was seized;\nand\n\n\nSearch, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under\ndelayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA\nPowers in relation to terrorist acts and terrorism offences  Division 3A\n\nSection 3UH\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(d) state that, if the owner does not request the return of the thing\nwithin 90 days after the date of the notice, the thing is\nforfeited to the Commonwealth.\nForfeiture of thing seized",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A seizure notice must:\n\n(a) identify the thing; and\n\n(b) state the date on which the thing was seized; and\n\n(c) state the ground or grounds on which the thing was seized;\nand\n\n\nSearch, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under\ndelayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA\nPowers in relation to terrorist acts and terrorism offences  Division 3A\n\nSection 3UH\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(d) state that, if the owner does not request the return of the thing\nwithin 90 days after the date of the notice, the thing is\nforfeited to the Commonwealth.\nForfeiture of thing seized",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uf"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uf-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uf-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5d44195a6dc9d82baceeb615b862206bdb8262f2824b731459981d28e92660d7",
      "skos:note": "Seizure notice must identify thing, state date seized, ground for seizure, and forfeiture conditions.",
      "dc:description": "a, b, c, d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3uf-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3UF(3) Seizure notices",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 88,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A seizure notice must:\n\n(a) identify the thing; and\n\n(b) state the date on which the thing was seized; and\n\n(c) state the ground or grounds on which the thing was seized;\nand\n\n\nSearch, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under\ndelayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA\nPowers in relation to terrorist acts and terrorism offences  Division 3A\n\nSection 3UH\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(d) state that, if the owner does not request the return of the thing\nwithin 90 days after the date of the notice, the thing is\nforfeited to the Commonwealth.\nForfeiture of thing seized"
    },
    {
