    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uj-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3UJ(4) Minister may make declarations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3uj-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.90",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Minister must revoke a declaration, in writing, if he or she is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) in the case of a declaration made on the ground mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(a)—there is no longer a terrorism threat that\njustifies the declaration being continued; or\n\n(b) in the case of a declaration made on the ground mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(b)—the declaration is no longer required.\nGazettal and publication of declaration",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Minister must revoke a declaration, in writing, if he or she is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) in the case of a declaration made on the ground mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(a)—there is no longer a terrorism threat that\njustifies the declaration being continued; or\n\n(b) in the case of a declaration made on the ground mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(b)—the declaration is no longer required.\nGazettal and publication of declaration",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uj"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uj-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uj-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dfbc472f045c3f8837e86e8b1c02440831d31cbb49b7fedb588146705bdad09b",
      "skos:note": "Minister must revoke declaration under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3uj-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3UJ(4) Minister may make declarations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 90,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Minister must revoke a declaration, in writing, if he or she is\nsatisfied that:\n\n(a) in the case of a declaration made on the ground mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(a)—there is no longer a terrorism threat that\njustifies the declaration being continued; or\n\n(b) in the case of a declaration made on the ground mentioned in\nparagraph (1)(b)—the declaration is no longer required.\nGazettal and publication of declaration"
    },
