    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uj-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3UJ(5) Minister may make declarations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3uj-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.90",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If a declaration of a Commonwealth place as a prescribed security\nzone under this section is made or revoked, the Minister must\narrange for:\n\n(a) a statement to be prepared that:\n\n(i) states that the declaration has been made or revoked, as\nthe case may be; and\n\n(ii) identifies the prescribed security zone; and\n\n(b) the statement to be:\n\n(i) broadcast by a television or radio station so as to be\ncapable of being received within the place; and\n\n(ii) published in the Gazette; and\n\n(iii) published on the internet.\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If a declaration of a Commonwealth place as a prescribed security\nzone under this section is made or revoked, the Minister must\narrange for:\n\n(a) a statement to be prepared that:\n\n(i) states that the declaration has been made or revoked, as\nthe case may be; and\n\n(ii) identifies the prescribed security zone; and\n\n(b) the statement to be:\n\n(i) broadcast by a television or radio station so as to be\ncapable of being received within the place; and\n\n(ii) published in the Gazette; and\n\n(iii) published on the internet.\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uj"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uj-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uj-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3uj-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c00aba04527d7a6793b9d60084456cb4ba08a251625dba0a3d97865f31997729",
      "skos:note": "Must arrange for a statement to be prepared and published in certain ways upon declaration of a security zone.",
      "dc:description": "statement, broadcast, publication"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3uj-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3UJ(5) Minister may make declarations",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 90,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If a declaration of a Commonwealth place as a prescribed security\nzone under this section is made or revoked, the Minister must\narrange for:\n\n(a) a statement to be prepared that:\n\n(i) states that the declaration has been made or revoked, as\nthe case may be; and\n\n(ii) identifies the prescribed security zone; and\n\n(b) the statement to be:\n\n(i) broadcast by a television or radio station so as to be\ncapable of being received within the place; and\n\n(ii) published in the Gazette; and\n\n(iii) published on the internet.\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)"
    },
