    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 December 2026.",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.96",
      "values:originalText": "Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under\ndelayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA\nPowers in relation to terrorist acts and terrorism offences  Division 3A\n\nSection 3UK\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(2) A declaration under section 3UJ that is in force at the end of\n7 December 2026 ceases to be in force at that time.\n\n(3) A police officer cannot apply for, and the Minister cannot make, a\ndeclaration under section 3UJ after 7 December 2026.\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
      "skos:definition": "Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under\ndelayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA\nPowers in relation to terrorist acts and terrorism offences  Division 3A\n\nSection 3UK\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(2) A declaration under section 3UJ that is in force at the end of\n7 December 2026 ceases to be in force at that time.\n\n(3) A police officer cannot apply for, and the Minister cannot make, a\ndeclaration under section 3UJ after 7 December 2026.\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
      "cml:hasPart": [
