    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3un",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3UN Meaning of public order and safe operation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3un"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.99",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this Division, the public order and safe operation of a major\nairport means:\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In this Division, the public order and safe operation of a major\nairport means:\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3un-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5d1aeb82d5434e60efd3635fdb417ea5a97f187dfdf1ece7ae13347523986263",
      "skos:note": "Defines public order and safe operation of a major airport"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3un",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3UN Meaning of public order and safe operation",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 99,
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this Division, the public order and safe operation of a major\nairport means:\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3un-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
