    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3up-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3UP(2) Identity information at airports",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3up-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.101",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A person must comply with a direction under subsection (1) by:\n\n(a) producing a government photographic identity document\nissued in relation to the person; or\n\n(b) if the person does not produce such a document—producing:\n\n(i)  another identity document in relation to the person; or\n\n(ii) if so directed by the constable or officer—2 different\nidentity documents in relation to the person; or\n\n(c) if the person does not produce an identity document (or\ndocuments) under paragraph (a) or (b)—giving the constable\nor officer the person’s name, address and date of birth.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A person must comply with a direction under subsection (1) by:\n\n(a) producing a government photographic identity document\nissued in relation to the person; or\n\n(b) if the person does not produce such a document—producing:\n\n(i)  another identity document in relation to the person; or\n\n(ii) if so directed by the constable or officer—2 different\nidentity documents in relation to the person; or\n\n(c) if the person does not produce an identity document (or\ndocuments) under paragraph (a) or (b)—giving the constable\nor officer the person’s name, address and date of birth.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3up"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3up-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3up-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2f862659bbebde1ab3aef11fec2756062403098c69fe087c5a2e0d30365a7c59",
      "skos:note": "Must provide identification documents or personal details upon request.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3up-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3UP(2) Identity information at airports",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 101,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A person must comply with a direction under subsection (1) by:\n\n(a) producing a government photographic identity document\nissued in relation to the person; or\n\n(b) if the person does not produce such a document—producing:\n\n(i)  another identity document in relation to the person; or\n\n(ii) if so directed by the constable or officer—2 different\nidentity documents in relation to the person; or\n\n(c) if the person does not produce an identity document (or\ndocuments) under paragraph (a) or (b)—giving the constable\nor officer the person’s name, address and date of birth."
    },
