      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.105",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The constable or officer must give the person any of the following\ninformation if requested by the person:\n\n(a) the constable’s or officer’s name;\n\n(b) the address of the constable’s or officer’s place of duty;\n\n(c) the constable’s or officer’s identification number (if any);\n\n(d) if the constable or officer has no identification number—the\nconstable’s or officer’s rank.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The constable or officer must give the person any of the following\ninformation if requested by the person:\n\n(a) the constable’s or officer’s name;\n\n(b) the address of the constable’s or officer’s place of duty;\n\n(c) the constable’s or officer’s identification number (if any);\n\n(d) if the constable or officer has no identification number—the\nconstable’s or officer’s rank.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3ut"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3ut-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3ut-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d096d07b55caa5e66c1ffaaaf532a88a5ea9450f7b5e89037603a2824e66b27a",
      "skos:note": "Must provide personal information upon request",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3ut-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3UT(3) Constables’ and protective service officers’ duties at airports",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 105,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The constable or officer must give the person any of the following\ninformation if requested by the person:\n\n(a) the constable’s or officer’s name;\n\n(b) the address of the constable’s or officer’s place of duty;\n\n(c) the constable’s or officer’s identification number (if any);\n\n(d) if the constable or officer has no identification number—the\nconstable’s or officer’s rank."
    },
