      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3x-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Magistrate obligation to issue a warrant.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) If the Magistrate is satisfied...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Magistrate MUST issue a warrant."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3x-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "ACCORDING_TO",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Conveyance in accordance with the warrant.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(b) directing that the person, having been conveyed...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The conveyance is ACCORDING TO the warrant."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3x-ss-3-logic-argumentation-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "IMPLIES",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Detention based on lawful imprisonment term.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "the person is required by law to undergo.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "If the person is required by law to undergo, they must be detained."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3x-ss-3-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "IS",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Detention is a state of being.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "the term of imprisonment or other detention that...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The detention IS the term of imprisonment or other detention."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3x-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3X(4) Arrest of prisoner unlawfully at large",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3x-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.111",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In this section:\nprisoner unlawfully at large means a person who is at large\n(otherwise than because the person has escaped from lawful\ncustody) at a time when the person is required by law to be\ndetained under a provision of a law of the Commonwealth,\nincluding Divisions 6 to 9, inclusive, of Part IB.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In this section:\nprisoner unlawfully at large means a person who is at large\n(otherwise than because the person has escaped from lawful\ncustody) at a time when the person is required by law to be\ndetained under a provision of a law of the Commonwealth,\nincluding Divisions 6 to 9, inclusive, of Part IB.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3x"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3x-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3x-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e45f2b8603546ce221ab5f4da54719ecd8df5cd84ed70c0816e62019a89aa782",
      "skos:note": "Definition of prisoner unlawfully at large"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3x-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3X(4) Arrest of prisoner unlawfully at large",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 111,
      "values:originalText": "(4) In this section:\nprisoner unlawfully at large means a person who is at large\n(otherwise than because the person has escaped from lawful\ncustody) at a time when the person is required by law to be\ndetained under a provision of a law of the Commonwealth,\nincluding Divisions 6 to 9, inclusive, of Part IB."
    },
    {
