      "cml:premiseText": "None",
      "cml:conclusionText": "prisoner unlawfully at large means..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3y",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3Y Power of arrest without warrant of person on bail",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3y"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.111",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A constable may, without warrant, arrest a person who has been\nreleased on bail if the constable believes on reasonable grounds\nthat the person has contravened or is about to contravene a\ncondition of a recognisance on which bail was granted to the\nperson in respect of an offence, even though the condition was\nimposed in a State or Territory other than the one in which the\nperson is.\n\n(2) Subject to subsection (3), if a constable arrests a person under\nsubsection (1), the constable must cause the person to be brought\nbefore a magistrate as soon as is practicable.\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A constable may, without warrant, arrest a person who has been\nreleased on bail if the constable believes on reasonable grounds\nthat the person has contravened or is about to contravene a\ncondition of a recognisance on which bail was granted to the\nperson in respect of an offence, even though the condition was\nimposed in a State or Territory other than the one in which the\nperson is.\n\n(2) Subject to subsection (3), if a constable arrests a person under\nsubsection (1), the constable must cause the person to be brought\nbefore a magistrate as soon as is practicable.\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3y-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3y-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fedac65dc4f8b57f3a2084496f0280fa70daeea4e41dcf6a0107834198a9789b"
    },
    {
