    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zi-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3ZI(5) Rules for conduct of strip search",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3zi-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.118",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If any of a person’s garments are seized as a result of a strip search,\nthe person must be provided with adequate clothing.\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If any of a person’s garments are seized as a result of a strip search,\nthe person must be provided with adequate clothing.\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zi"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
