      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.120",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Subject to subsection (9), a constable must not take identification\nmaterial from a person who is under 10.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Subject to subsection (9), a constable must not take identification\nmaterial from a person who is under 10.",
