    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zj-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3ZJ(6) Taking fingerprints, recordings, samples of handwriting or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3zj-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.120",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Subject to this section, a constable must not take identification\nmaterial (other than hand prints, finger prints, foot prints or toe\nprints) from a suspect who:\n\n(a) is at least 10 but under 18, or is incapable of managing his or\nher affairs; and\n\n(b) has not been arrested and charged;\nunless a magistrate orders that the material be taken.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Subject to this section, a constable must not take identification\nmaterial (other than hand prints, finger prints, foot prints or toe\nprints) from a suspect who:\n\n(a) is at least 10 but under 18, or is incapable of managing his or\nher affairs; and\n\n(b) has not been arrested and charged;\nunless a magistrate orders that the material be taken.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zj"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zj-ss-6-norm"
        },
