        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zj-ss-6-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zj-ss-6-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zj-ss-6-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "90ecbeba6fe0f043094ecdd3eec790fb33f66ca8ac739977140f205df7324dbd",
      "skos:note": "Taking fingerprints, recordings, samples of handwriting or other identification material from a suspect under 18 or incapable of managing their affairs without a magistrate's order."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3zj-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3ZJ(6) Taking fingerprints, recordings, samples of handwriting or",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 120,
      "values:originalText": "(6) Subject to this section, a constable must not take identification\nmaterial (other than hand prints, finger prints, foot prints or toe\nprints) from a suspect who:\n\n(a) is at least 10 but under 18, or is incapable of managing his or\nher affairs; and\n\n(b) has not been arrested and charged;\nunless a magistrate orders that the material be taken."
    },
