      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.120",
      "values:originalText": "(8) The taking of identification material from a person who:\n\n(a) is under 18; or\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
      "skos:definition": "(8) The taking of identification material from a person who:\n\n(a) is under 18; or\n\n\nPart IAA  Search, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers\nunder delayed notification search warrants)",
