    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3ZL(3A) Offence of refusing to allow identification material to be taken",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3zl-ss-3a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.124",
      "values:originalText": "(3A) The judge or magistrate may also make any other orders that are\nreasonably necessary for ensuring that the impressions of the\nperson’s fingerprints and/or a photograph of the person are taken in\naccordance with the order under subsection (1). For example, the\njudge or magistrate may order the person to attend a specified\npolice station at a specified time.",
      "skos:definition": "(3A) The judge or magistrate may also make any other orders that are\nreasonably necessary for ensuring that the impressions of the\nperson’s fingerprints and/or a photograph of the person are taken in\naccordance with the order under subsection (1). For example, the\njudge or magistrate may order the person to attend a specified\npolice station at a specified time.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0db589c5403748a09da62f6cfbbc0cc69e6aec16daa59c99c227b2c71f70ddf4",
      "skos:note": "Judge or magistrate may order person to attend police station."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3zl-ss-3a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3ZL(3A) Offence of refusing to allow identification material to be taken",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 124,
      "values:originalText": "(3A) The judge or magistrate may also make any other orders that are\nreasonably necessary for ensuring that the impressions of the\nperson’s fingerprints and/or a photograph of the person are taken in\naccordance with the order under subsection (1). For example, the\njudge or magistrate may order the person to attend a specified\npolice station at a specified time."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3a"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3a-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must provide",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person must attend the police station."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3ZL(3B) Offence of refusing to allow identification material to be taken",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3zl-ss-3b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.124",
      "values:originalText": "(3B) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person is subject to an order under subsection (3A); and\n\n(b) the person engages in conduct; and\n\n(c) the person’s conduct contravenes the order.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months.\n\n\nSearch, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under\ndelayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA\nArrest and related matters  Division 4\n\nSection 3ZM\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(3B) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person is subject to an order under subsection (3A); and\n\n(b) the person engages in conduct; and\n\n(c) the person’s conduct contravenes the order.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months.\n\n\nSearch, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under\ndelayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA\nArrest and related matters  Division 4\n\nSection 3ZM\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3b-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3b-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3b-logic-alleninterval-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3b-logic-argumentation-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3b-logic-diffusion-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7205844bfa3eb25b989087fe32baa5cfc5e49046c5e8e40ebaf3841e3454e6a2",
      "skos:note": "Refusing to allow identification material to be taken is an offence."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3zl-ss-3b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3ZL(3B) Offence of refusing to allow identification material to be taken",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 124,
      "values:originalText": "(3B) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person is subject to an order under subsection (3A); and\n\n(b) the person engages in conduct; and\n\n(c) the person’s conduct contravenes the order.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 12 months.\n\n\nSearch, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under\ndelayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA\nArrest and related matters  Division 4\n\nSection 3ZM\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zl-ss-3b-norm",
