      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.125",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subject to subsection (3) and to section 3ZN, an identification\nparade:\n\n(a) may be held if the suspect agrees; or\n\n(b) must be held if:\n\n(i) the suspect has requested that an identification parade\nbe held; and\n\n(ii) it is reasonable in the circumstances to do so.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subject to subsection (3) and to section 3ZN, an identification\nparade:\n\n(a) may be held if the suspect agrees; or\n\n(b) must be held if:\n\n(i) the suspect has requested that an identification parade\nbe held; and\n\n(ii) it is reasonable in the circumstances to do so.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zm"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zm-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zm-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zm-ss-2-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8335252b31d54c7ba8cb5424f47e7d3686a8143bebd87cf5c6e91dcc44da9975",
      "skos:note": "Suspect may request identification parade, and it must be held if reasonable in circumstances."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3zm-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3ZM(2) Identification parades",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 125,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subject to subsection (3) and to section 3ZN, an identification\nparade:\n\n(a) may be held if the suspect agrees; or\n\n(b) must be held if:\n\n(i) the suspect has requested that an identification parade\nbe held; and\n\n(ii) it is reasonable in the circumstances to do so."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zm-ss-2-norm",
