    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zu",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "3ZU Offences relating to telephone warrants",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3zu"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.164",
      "values:originalText": "A person must not:\n\n\nSearch, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under\ndelayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA\nGeneral  Division 5\n\nSection 3ZW\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) state in a document that purports to be a form of warrant\nunder section 3R the name of an issuing officer unless that\nofficer issued the warrant; or\n\n(b) state on a form of warrant under that section a matter that, to\nthe person’s knowledge, departs in a material particular from\nthe form authorised by the issuing officer; or\n\n(c) purport to execute, or present to a person, a document that\npurports to be a form of warrant under that section that the\nperson knows:\n\n(i) has not been approved by an issuing officer under that\nsection; or\n\n(ii) to depart in a material particular from the terms\nauthorised by an issuing officer under that section; or\n\n(d) give to an issuing officer a form of warrant under that section\nthat is not the form of warrant that the person purported to\nexecute.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 2 years.",
      "skos:definition": "A person must not:\n\n\nSearch, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under\ndelayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA\nGeneral  Division 5\n\nSection 3ZW\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) state in a document that purports to be a form of warrant\nunder section 3R the name of an issuing officer unless that\nofficer issued the warrant; or\n\n(b) state on a form of warrant under that section a matter that, to\nthe person’s knowledge, departs in a material particular from\nthe form authorised by the issuing officer; or\n\n(c) purport to execute, or present to a person, a document that\npurports to be a form of warrant under that section that the\nperson knows:\n\n(i) has not been approved by an issuing officer under that\nsection; or\n\n(ii) to depart in a material particular from the terms\nauthorised by an issuing officer under that section; or\n\n(d) give to an issuing officer a form of warrant under that section\nthat is not the form of warrant that the person purported to\nexecute.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 2 years.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zu-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zu-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3836613f8e0becb49a3194ff017b4ea66cab76f43e75eedb5530d0b7883f24e4",
      "skos:note": "Do not state incorrect information on warrants."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-3zu",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3ZU Offences relating to telephone warrants",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 164,
      "values:originalText": "A person must not:\n\n\nSearch, information gathering, arrest and related powers (other than powers under\ndelayed notification search warrants)  Part IAA\nGeneral  Division 5\n\nSection 3ZW\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(a) state in a document that purports to be a form of warrant\nunder section 3R the name of an issuing officer unless that\nofficer issued the warrant; or\n\n(b) state on a form of warrant under that section a matter that, to\nthe person’s knowledge, departs in a material particular from\nthe form authorised by the issuing officer; or\n\n(c) purport to execute, or present to a person, a document that\npurports to be a form of warrant under that section that the\nperson knows:\n\n(i) has not been approved by an issuing officer under that\nsection; or\n\n(ii) to depart in a material particular from the terms\nauthorised by an issuing officer under that section; or\n\n(d) give to an issuing officer a form of warrant under that section\nthat is not the form of warrant that the person purported to\nexecute.\nPenalty: Imprisonment for 2 years."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zu-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-3zu"
