    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-4aa-ss-1a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4AA(1A) Penalty units",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 327,
      "values:originalText": "(1A) If the amount of a penalty unit is indexed under subsection (3), the\nMinister must, by notifiable instrument, publish the amount of a\npenalty unit. However, a failure by the Minister to do so does not\ninvalidate the indexation."
    },
    {
