      "values:originalText": "(2) In this section:\nTerritory Ordinance means an ordinance that:\n\n(a) was made under an Act providing for the acceptance,\nadministration or government of a Territory; and\n\n(b) has not become an enactment of the Australian Capital\nTerritory;\nand includes a regulation made under such an ordinance."
