      "skos:definition": "(1) A reference in a law of the Commonwealth or in a Territory\nOrdinance to a pecuniary penalty of D dollars, where D is a\nnumber, is taken to be a reference to a pecuniary penalty of P\npenalty units, where P is:\n\n(a) if D   100 is a whole number—that whole number; or\n\n(b) if D   100 is not a whole number—the next highest whole\nnumber.",
