      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.332",
      "values:originalText": "(1A) Subsection (1) applies to a penalty set out:\n\n(a) at the foot of a section of an Act; or\n\n(b) at the foot of a subsection of an Act, but not at the foot of the\nsection containing the subsection; or\n\n(c) at the foot of a clause of any Schedule to an Act; or\n\n(d) at the foot of a subclause of any Schedule to an Act, but not\nat the foot of the clause containing the subclause.",
      "skos:definition": "(1A) Subsection (1) applies to a penalty set out:\n\n(a) at the foot of a section of an Act; or\n\n(b) at the foot of a subsection of an Act, but not at the foot of the\nsection containing the subsection; or\n\n(c) at the foot of a clause of any Schedule to an Act; or\n\n(d) at the foot of a subclause of any Schedule to an Act, but not\nat the foot of the clause containing the subclause.",
      "values:partOf": {
