      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-4f",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4F Effect of alterations in penalties",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-4f"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.332",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Where a provision of a law of the Commonwealth increases the\npenalty or maximum penalty for an offence, the penalty or\n\n\nGeneral  Part IA\n\nSection 4G\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nmaximum penalty as increased applies only to offences committed\nafter the commencement of that provision.\n\n(2) Where a provision of a law of the Commonwealth reduces the\npenalty or maximum penalty for an offence, the penalty or\nmaximum penalty as reduced extends to offences committed before\nthe commencement of that provision, but the reduction does not\naffect any penalty imposed before that commencement.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Where a provision of a law of the Commonwealth increases the\npenalty or maximum penalty for an offence, the penalty or\n\n\nGeneral  Part IA\n\nSection 4G\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nmaximum penalty as increased applies only to offences committed\nafter the commencement of that provision.\n\n(2) Where a provision of a law of the Commonwealth reduces the\npenalty or maximum penalty for an offence, the penalty or\nmaximum penalty as reduced extends to offences committed before\nthe commencement of that provision, but the reduction does not\naffect any penalty imposed before that commencement.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-4f-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-4f-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "51e723fd052cd49f8ebff94a1798580b1f7e9dcee0285d9384dffdb748b9dbf7"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-4f",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4F Effect of alterations in penalties",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 332,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Where a provision of a law of the Commonwealth increases the\npenalty or maximum penalty for an offence, the penalty or\n\n\nGeneral  Part IA\n\nSection 4G\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nmaximum penalty as increased applies only to offences committed\nafter the commencement of that provision.\n\n(2) Where a provision of a law of the Commonwealth reduces the\npenalty or maximum penalty for an offence, the penalty or\nmaximum penalty as reduced extends to offences committed before\nthe commencement of that provision, but the reduction does not\naffect any penalty imposed before that commencement."
    },
