      "skos:definition": "(1) Where a provision of a law of the Commonwealth increases the\npenalty or maximum penalty for an offence, the penalty or\n\n\nGeneral  Part IA\n\nSection 4G\n\nCrimes Act 1914\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nmaximum penalty as increased applies only to offences committed\nafter the commencement of that provision.",
