      "skos:definition": "(2) Where a provision of a law of the Commonwealth reduces the\npenalty or maximum penalty for an offence, the penalty or\nmaximum penalty as reduced extends to offences committed before\nthe commencement of that provision, but the reduction does not\naffect any penalty imposed before that commencement.",
