      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.333",
      "values:originalText": "Offences against a law of the Commonwealth punishable by\nimprisonment for a period exceeding 12 months are indictable\noffences, unless the contrary intention appears.",
      "skos:definition": "Offences against a law of the Commonwealth punishable by\nimprisonment for a period exceeding 12 months are indictable\noffences, unless the contrary intention appears.",
      "cml:asserts": [
