    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15b-ss-1a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15B(1A) Time for commencement of prosecutions",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15b-ss-1a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-act-1914.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.351",
      "values:originalText": "(1A) A prosecution of a body corporate for an offence against any law\nof the Commonwealth may be commenced as follows:\n\n(a) if the maximum penalty which may be imposed for the\noffence in respect of a body corporate is, or includes, a fine\nof more than 150 penalty units in the case of a first\nconviction—at any time;\n\n(b) in any other case—at any time within one year after the\ncommission of the offence.",
      "skos:definition": "(1A) A prosecution of a body corporate for an offence against any law\nof the Commonwealth may be commenced as follows:\n\n(a) if the maximum penalty which may be imposed for the\noffence in respect of a body corporate is, or includes, a fine\nof more than 150 penalty units in the case of a first\nconviction—at any time;\n\n(b) in any other case—at any time within one year after the\ncommission of the offence.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-act-1914-sec-15b-ss-1a-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ac53c0627e580805b97b7efba807c4338ec26d6b4fc8f804dac2adca2802baa3",
      "skos:note": "Prosecution of a body corporate for an offence against any law of the Commonwealth may be commenced at any time within one year after commission of the offence, except in cases where maximum penalty is more than 150 penalty units."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-act-1914#sec-15b-ss-1a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15B(1A) Time for commencement of prosecutions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 351,
      "values:originalText": "(1A) A prosecution of a body corporate for an offence against any law\nof the Commonwealth may be commenced as follows:\n\n(a) if the maximum penalty which may be imposed for the\noffence in respect of a body corporate is, or includes, a fine\nof more than 150 penalty units in the case of a first\nconviction—at any time;\n\n(b) in any other case—at any time within one year after the\ncommission of the offence."
    },
    {
